Package: glycoPathDesign
Type: Package
Title: Design Glycoform Panels for Biosynthetic Pathway Inference
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yusuke", "Matsui", email = "matsui.yusuke.d4@f.mail.nagoya-u.ac.jp",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Defines glycoform biosynthetic reaction networks and evaluates
    whether proposed measurement panels can distinguish specified effective
    reaction-rate classes. The package provides steady-state forward models,
    local log-rate Jacobians, panel-dimension and rank checks, conditioning and
    measurement-precision diagnostics, panel enumeration and optimisation,
    forward-model fitting, operating-point robustness analysis, supported-
    resolution summaries, and an optional Shiny application. Results are local
    and conditional on the supplied network, observation mapping, operating
    points, secretion model, and measurement-error assumptions.
